    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean \"an escape\"? it feels like there's no way to just... be quiet. everything is a constant struggle to stay relevant or even just to keep up. it's exhausting. i feel like i've already reached the end of my chapter, but the book just keeps going without me.",
