      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Escape\" doesn't mean running away, it means finding a quiet place inside where the noise can't reach you. You don't have to keep up with the book; you can simply close it. That exhaustion you feel is the signal that you've been fighting a battle that was never yours to fight. Maybe the only way to stop the relentless turning of the pages is to finally let yourself stop reading.",
